"offer telemetry through the i-BUS protocol. For more information about i-BUS"
" telemetry, refer to the :ref:`i-BUS Telemetry page <common-ibus-"
"telemetry>`."
msgstr ""
"Flysky有许多兼容接收机。部分输出PWM，部分输出i-BUS/SBus。许多支持通过i-BUS协议进行数传。有关i-BUS数传的更多信息，请参见 "
":ref:`i-BUS数传页面 <common-ibus-telemetry>`。"

